2026-11-07T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2478) 'ANNY-soma-x: RF-DETR keypoints, HairDeck, muscle-supermimic and the pose and shape sweep
 # uuid: 4c18912d-c49f-51bc-bf55-01ea3edd2cce
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Prediscussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-11-07T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2478) 'ANNY-soma-x gains a keypoint head, a hair occluder and muscle-driven motion.
 # tags: rfd:feature, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2478) 'the ANNY-soma-x mesh and dataset pipeline on the Windows desk's RTX 4090.
 # tags: rfd:scope, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2478) 'Can ANNY-soma-x (the reference rig's SOMA-X variant) read a keypoint head, a hair occluder and a muscle-driven motion source without crossing a licence line?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2478) 'Nothing is started yet. RF-DETR Keypoint (Preview, 576 px, Apache-2.0) runs on the Windows desk, a pixi env with Python 3.12 and CUDA PyTorch; depth from it is ground truth only, never training data. HairDeck covers hair as both an occluder and an avatar part on CUDA. muscle-supermimic's MyoFullBody (24 GB) and the entities-model-explorer motion clips are the motion sources, retargeted to the 78 ANNY joints with rotation-star. The licences read on 2026-11-02: SOMA-X and ANNY code are Apache-2.0, ANNY data is CC0, so ANNY-soma-x meshes and datasets can be published with attribution; AMASS clips are SMPL-derived and are not used; HairDeck's code and weights are Apache-2.0, and its DINOv3 encoder carries the DINOv3 License.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2478) 'A keypoint head, a hair occluder pass and one retargeted muscle-driven clip each run end to end on the desk, and the publish manifest lists every asset's licence class.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2478) 'ANNY-soma-x: RF-DETR keypoints, HairDeck, muscle-supermimic and the pose and shape sweep
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Run RF-DETR Keypoint on the Windows desk's RTX 4090 pixi env (Python 3.12, CUDA PyTorch). Its depth output is ground truth for evaluation only and is never folded into training data.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Add HairDeck on CUDA for two roles: hair as an occluder in the keypoint pass, and hair as an avatar part on the published mesh.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Retarget muscle-supermimic's MyoFullBody (24 GB) and the entities-model-explorer motion clips to the 78 ANNY joints with rotation-star as the motion source for muscle-driven poses.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Clear each asset against its licence before publish: SOMA-X and ANNY code (Apache-2.0) and ANNY data (CC0) clear ANNY-soma-x meshes and datasets for publication with attribution. No AMASS clip is used, published or unpublished: the blocklist's SMPL row covers internal research too. HairDeck hair enters a publish manifest with the DINOv3 License named beside it.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2478) 'The pose and shape sweep
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2478) 'The sweep covers the pose and shape space ANNY-soma-x must cover: a grid of body shapes crossed with a set of muscle-driven poses from the retargeted motion clips, each rendered through the RF-DETR keypoint head with HairDeck's occluder active.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2478) 'Open questions
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Whether rotation-star retargeting onto the 78 ANNY joints preserves muscle-supermimic's joint limits, or needs a clamp pass.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Which MyoFullBody and entities-model-explorer clips have no SMPL in their history. A clip that cannot show it is left out of the sweep.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2478  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2478) '- Whether RF-DETR's 576 px input resolution undersamples the hand and face keypoints ANNY needs, or a crop-and-rerun pass is required.
 # tags: rfd:details
